    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλοχος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ</span>-copul., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέχος</span>) poet., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>partner of one's bed, wife,</i>
