				Il.
				1.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.403
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				181
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				543
			</span></i>, etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1253b7
			</span></i>; 
